WEBVTT

00:00:28.237 --> 00:00:29.988
(horse whinnies)

00:00:40.374 --> 00:00:42.209
(men shouting)

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:07.276
(grunts)

00:01:14.032 --> 00:01:15.492
(grunts)

00:01:42.186 --> 00:01:44.271
(creaking)

00:01:46.899 --> 00:01:48.942
He's seen us.

00:01:58.076 --> 00:02:00.162
(horse whinnies)

00:02:02.623 --> 00:02:04.082
Take care of him.

00:02:10.756 --> 00:02:12.674
No!

00:02:12.758 --> 00:02:15.511
(blowing horn)

00:02:15.594 --> 00:02:16.929
(horn honking)

00:02:17.012 --> 00:02:20.098
- (man) Mind yourself, love.
- I'm sorry.

00:02:20.182 --> 00:02:21.892
Watch where you're going!

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:23.644
Wait for me!

00:02:36.865 --> 00:02:39.451
You go to Saint Finbar's?

00:02:39.535 --> 00:02:40.911
That's right.

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:44.122
I go to Hendon House. Across the road.

00:02:45.249 --> 00:02:46.708
I've seen you...

00:02:48.293 --> 00:02:49.753
...sitting by yourself.

00:02:52.297 --> 00:02:55.884
Yes, well... I prefer to be left alone.

00:02:58.345 --> 00:02:59.763
Me, too.

00:02:59.846 --> 00:03:01.974
What's your name?

00:03:04.059 --> 00:03:06.353
- Phyllis.
- (girl) Susan!

00:03:08.689 --> 00:03:10.691
You'd better come quickly.

00:03:14.653 --> 00:03:18.865
(man) Paper here!
Get your daily paper!

00:03:28.709 --> 00:03:32.546
(children shouting)

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:44.891
(grunting)

00:03:56.695 --> 00:03:57.738
Edmund!

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.242
Go on! Kick him in the face!

00:04:09.249 --> 00:04:10.500
Ah!

00:04:12.294 --> 00:04:14.504
(man blowing whistle)

00:04:14.588 --> 00:04:17.841
(man) Break it up.
That's enough. Come on.

00:04:19.217 --> 00:04:21.053
That's it. Get up.

00:04:22.262 --> 00:04:23.430
Act your age!

00:04:32.314 --> 00:04:35.859
- You're welcome.
- I had it sorted.

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:38.195
(Susan) What was it this time?

00:04:38.278 --> 00:04:41.406
- He bumped me.
- So you hit him?

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:46.328
No. After he bumped me,
they tried to make me apologize.

00:04:46.411 --> 00:04:47.913
That's when I hit him.

00:04:47.996 --> 00:04:50.207
Is it that hard just to walk away?

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:51.249
I shouldn't have to.

00:04:51.333 --> 00:04:54.544
I mean, don't you ever get tired
of being treated like a kid?

00:04:54.628 --> 00:04:56.213
Um, we are kids.

00:04:56.296 --> 00:04:58.131
I wasn't always.

00:04:59.591 --> 00:05:01.259
It's been a year.

00:05:02.678 --> 00:05:04.721
How long does he expect us to wait?

00:05:04.805 --> 00:05:07.432
I think it's time to accept
that we live here.

00:05:07.516 --> 00:05:09.976
It's no use pretending any different.

00:05:11.144 --> 00:05:14.398
- (train approaching)
- (Susan) Oh, no.

00:05:15.982 --> 00:05:19.069
- Pretend you're talking to me.
- We are talking to you.

00:05:19.152 --> 00:05:21.571
- (scoffs)
- Ow!

00:05:21.655 --> 00:05:24.199
- Quiet, Lu.
- Something pinched me!

00:05:24.282 --> 00:05:25.784
- Stop pulling!
- Not touching you.

00:05:25.867 --> 00:05:29.121
Look, would all of you just...
What is that?

00:05:29.204 --> 00:05:31.581
- It feels like magic.
- Quick, everyone hold hands.

00:05:31.665 --> 00:05:33.667
- I'm not holding your hand!
- Just...

